WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.557
- Meeting new people is the spice of life,

00:00:02.557 --> 00:00:04.850
but sometimes, you look
all over the kitchen,

00:00:04.850 --> 00:00:06.852
and you don't know
where the spice rack is.

00:00:06.852 --> 00:00:08.421
You need someone to show you the way.

00:00:08.421 --> 00:00:10.793
So, I'm gonna find two people
and demand that they hang out

00:00:10.793 --> 00:00:12.391
with each other all day.

00:00:12.391 --> 00:00:14.504
Let's see how it goes.

00:00:14.504 --> 00:00:17.020
(mischievous music)

00:00:17.020 --> 00:00:18.803
- Do you like meeting new people?

00:00:18.803 --> 00:00:19.695
- Yes, of course.

00:00:19.695 --> 00:00:20.528
- I do!

00:00:20.528 --> 00:00:22.793
I'm from Australia, so I'm
getting to know all new people.

00:00:22.793 --> 00:00:23.785
- Yeah, sometimes.

00:00:23.785 --> 00:00:24.618
- Of course.

00:00:24.618 --> 00:00:25.451
- I'm antisocial.

00:00:25.451 --> 00:00:27.371
- People are wonderful,
as long as they're nice.

00:00:27.371 --> 00:00:28.857
- If I found someone random for you

00:00:28.857 --> 00:00:30.948
to hang out with all day, would you do it?

00:00:30.948 --> 00:00:33.214
- Well, I would have to
approve that randomness.

00:00:33.214 --> 00:00:34.047
- Uh, no.

00:00:34.047 --> 00:00:34.880
- Right now, no.

00:00:34.880 --> 00:00:35.713
- I think so, yeah.

00:00:35.713 --> 00:00:37.097
- Great, we got our first person!

00:00:37.097 --> 00:00:37.930
- I'll be fine.

00:00:37.930 --> 00:00:40.228
If they're open to sitting
down in the sun for a while

00:00:40.228 --> 00:00:43.304
at my job and then going
to party with me then

00:00:43.304 --> 00:00:45.537
they'll see how fun I am at that scene.

00:00:45.537 --> 00:00:47.631
- We just came to where we're supposed to

00:00:47.631 --> 00:00:48.630
meet up with Dustin.

00:00:48.630 --> 00:00:49.463
(ding)

00:00:49.463 --> 00:00:51.532
He didn't have a working
cellphone here in the US.

00:00:51.532 --> 00:00:52.365
We'll see.

00:00:52.365 --> 00:00:53.323
Time to wait.

00:00:53.323 --> 00:00:57.282
(rhythmic, languid music)

00:00:57.282 --> 00:00:58.115
(beep)

00:00:58.115 --> 00:01:01.229
Well, unfortunately our first
guy we found didn't show up,

00:01:01.229 --> 00:01:03.581
so he had to get on the bus and go.

00:01:03.581 --> 00:01:04.414
We're back to square one.

00:01:04.414 --> 00:01:06.822
How would you feel about a
random stranger joining you

00:01:06.822 --> 00:01:08.401
for everything you do
for the rest of the day?

00:01:08.401 --> 00:01:09.466
- I would totally do that.

00:01:09.466 --> 00:01:11.663
- I have Caitlyn and Gary
who have agreed to hang out

00:01:11.663 --> 00:01:12.867
with each other all day.

00:01:12.867 --> 00:01:14.250
- I've agreed almost.

00:01:14.250 --> 00:01:15.083
- Hi.

00:01:15.083 --> 00:01:15.916
- Hi, Caitlyn.

00:01:15.916 --> 00:01:16.749
- You from Australia?

00:01:16.749 --> 00:01:17.582
- I am from Australia.

00:01:17.582 --> 00:01:19.248
- Cool, what are you doing here?

00:01:19.248 --> 00:01:21.298
- I'm a filmmaker and my
film's playing in Shriekfest.

00:01:21.298 --> 00:01:22.131
- What's your movie about?

00:01:22.131 --> 00:01:24.157
- It's a horror-comedy about two girls who

00:01:24.157 --> 00:01:26.615
decide to do a blood
pact over a sleepover,

00:01:26.615 --> 00:01:29.083
and then they cut their
hands, can't stop bleeding.

00:01:29.083 --> 00:01:30.692
- Anyway, listen, I can't stay.

00:01:30.692 --> 00:01:31.525
(beep)

00:01:31.525 --> 00:01:34.073
- I've got Caitlyn and Bree,
game to hang out all day.

00:01:34.073 --> 00:01:35.365
Go ahead and meet each other!

00:01:35.365 --> 00:01:36.198
- Hi, Caitlyn.

00:01:36.198 --> 00:01:37.031
- Bree!

00:01:37.031 --> 00:01:37.864
- Lovely to meet you.

00:01:37.864 --> 00:01:38.697
- You too. Oh, this is easier.

00:01:38.697 --> 00:01:39.799
- I'm going to the Museum of Death.

00:01:39.799 --> 00:01:40.632
- Yes!

00:01:40.632 --> 00:01:41.465
- Are you happy to come to that?

00:01:41.465 --> 00:01:42.542
- I would absolutely go with you to that.

00:01:42.542 --> 00:01:44.723
- Perfect, and then I'm
going to Shriekfest later

00:01:44.723 --> 00:01:45.556
to see some films play.

00:01:45.556 --> 00:01:46.789
- So are you guys best friends yet?

00:01:46.789 --> 00:01:47.795
- Yeah!
- Pretty much.

00:01:47.795 --> 00:01:48.628
- Yeah!

00:01:48.628 --> 00:01:50.337
(inspirational music)

00:01:50.337 --> 00:01:51.829
- Alright , guys, have a great day.

00:01:51.829 --> 00:01:52.803
- Thanks.

00:01:52.803 --> 00:01:54.361
(upbeat rock music)

00:01:54.361 --> 00:01:55.327
- We went to the Museum of Death.

00:01:55.327 --> 00:01:56.577
- Oh, my gosh, I'm so excited.

00:01:56.577 --> 00:01:57.410
- Yes!

00:01:57.410 --> 00:01:58.807
- We met that lovely Australian girl

00:01:58.807 --> 00:01:59.879
