What we gonna do?

00:02:23.055 --> 00:02:24.053
- We're about to see a horror movie.

00:02:24.053 --> 00:02:24.944
- From where?

00:02:24.944 --> 00:02:26.091
- From Spain!

00:02:26.091 --> 00:02:27.714
- We're about to see how
Spain scares the crap

00:02:27.714 --> 00:02:28.628
