00:02:28.628 --> 00:02:29.461
That was a good movie.

00:02:29.461 --> 00:02:30.349
- It was well made.

00:02:30.349 --> 00:02:32.172
Bye, guys, we had a
really nice time tonight.

00:02:32.172 --> 00:02:33.251
- Shriekfest.

00:02:33.251 --> 00:02:34.564
You called an Uber and I
- Yeah, yeah I called it.

